SUMMARY:Art 101 | Visible mending for teens
DESCRIPTION:In this brief introduction to the slow art of visible mending\,
  we will explore simple hand stitching methods for mending small holes in 
 clothing. You will learn the methods for hand-patching and simple darning 
 or needleweaving. Bring in some clothing with wear-spots\, holes or stains
  that won’t budge\, and with some time\, patience\, and a little bit of 
 extra thread\, you can give old clothes a personal touch and extend its we
 arability!
LOCATION:Logan Art Gallery
URL:https://www.loganarts.com.au/event/art-101-visible-mending-for-teens/
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
